<title>SINGAPORE: Casa 1996 net profit falls 35.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Casa 1996 net profit falls 35.7 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>SINGAPORE, Dec 31, Reuter -  12 months to September 30 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    3.52   vs     5.47</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   1.68   vs     3.24</p>
<p>    Final net dividend (pct)	  5.00   vs     5.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			    104.09   vs    71.53</p>
<p>    Interest expense		    0.57   vs     0.58</p>
<p>    Operating pretax profit	   2.49   vs     4.88</p>
<p>    Associates			    3.17   vs     2.77</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 5.66   vs     7.65</p>
<p>    Tax				     2.15   vs     2.18</p>
<p>    Dividend pay/register -    April 30, 1997/April 16, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Casa Holdings Ltd is a distributor of household appliances, consumer electronic goods and bathroom fixtures.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
